     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Polite imperative",
     "texto": [
      "**Introduceți**, **apăsați** and **salvați** are instructions for several people or for one person addressed formally."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Steps",
     "texto": [
      "**Mai întâi** shows the first step; **apoi**, the next one. The Romanian imperative does not need a subject pronoun."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
